        "definition": "Microbiome is the broader ecological and functional system associated with a microbial community. Depending on context, it includes the microorganisms, their collective genetic material, metabolic products, interactions, and surrounding environment. It should not be used as an exact synonym for microbiota, which refers specifically to the organisms.",
