            "content": "Dengue virus is a clinically important virus associated with dengue fever, dengue with warning signs, and severe dengue and shock. The organism or agent name identifies the cause or association; it is not itself the disease diagnosis, and detection must be interpreted with the specimen, host, and syndrome.",
