            "reason": "HCV infects hepatocytes and commonly persists; chronic immune-mediated inflammation and fibrosis can progress to cirrhosis and liver cancer. No separate exact virulence-factor, toxin, or tissue destination is asserted because the bounded source packet supports the mechanism in prose but not an independent canonical target.",
