            "reason": "Avoid unnecessary urinary catheters, maintain closed-system catheter care, and address obstruction or stones through clinical evaluation. This agent's reviewed record describes endogenous overgrowth, reactivation, incompletely defined acquisition, or a rare iatrogenic context rather than one safe general transmission route. ANI therefore preserves the explanation without fabricating a route edge.",
