            "groupId": "pathogenesis",
            "reason": "Biofilm and adhesion to prosthetic material are clinically relevant, but the current local Microbiology catalog has no exact independently authored S. epidermidis biofilm or adhesion destination. Linking the S. aureus protein A concept would be biologically misleading, so this draft asserts no pathogenesis edge pending human review of a correct concept target.",
