            "reason": "Toxigenic strains colonize the small intestine and cholera toxin raises epithelial cyclic AMP, driving chloride and water secretion without tissue invasion. No separate exact virulence-factor, toxin, or tissue destination is asserted because the bounded source packet supports the mechanism in prose but not an independent canonical target.",
